| !Run for !GOGImport: gets Heroes III's files (Data, Maps, Mp3) out of the
| game's GOG installer for VCMI. Drag the installer onto the icon.
Set GOGImport$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <GOGImport$Dir>.!Sprites
| A file dropped on the application in a Filer window comes as %0.
Unset GOGImport$File
If "%*0"<>"" Then Set GOGImport$File %*0
RMEnsure UtilityModule 5.00 Error !GOGImport needs RISC OS 5
WimpSlot -min 512K -max 512K
BASIC -quit <GOGImport$Dir>.!RunImage
